{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Durations now roll over into hours correctly, so 3600 seconds shows as `1h 0m 0s` instead of `60m`.\n\nThe bug was in `format_hms` in `repo/timefmt.py`. It worked out minutes as `seconds // 60`, which counts every minute in the total, including the ones already counted as hours. It now only counts the minutes left over after the hours are taken out:\n\n```python\nh = seconds // 3600\nm = (seconds % 3600) // 60\ns = seconds % 60\n```\n\nI also deleted the `# BUG` comment above it, since it described the old behaviour.\n\nBoth tests in `tests/visible` pass. I also checked some edge values: 3599 gives `0h 59m 59s`, 3661 gives `1h 1m 1s`, and 90061 gives `25h 1m 1s`. Hours keep counting past 24 rather than turning into days, which is how it worked before. `old_format_hms` and `hms_summary` in `rows.py` both call `format_hms`, so they're fixed too."}]},"session_id":"bfdcea0e-baa4-459c-b30f-1851d5ecad18"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":28889,"duration_api_ms":28889,"is_error":false,"result":"I'll look for the duration formatting code.Durations now roll over into hours correctly, so 3600 seconds shows as `1h 0m 0s` instead of `60m`.\n\nThe bug was in `format_hms` in `repo/timefmt.py`. It worked out minutes as `seconds // 60`, which counts every minute in the total, including the ones already counted as hours. It now only counts the minutes left over after the hours are taken out:\n\n```python\nh = seconds // 3600\nm = (seconds % 3600) // 60\ns = seconds % 60\n```\n\nI also deleted the `# BUG` comment above it, since it described the old behaviour.\n\nBoth tests in `tests/visible` pass. I also checked some edge values: 3599 gives `0h 59m 59s`, 3661 gives `1h 1m 1s`, and 90061 gives `25h 1m 1s`. Hours keep counting past 24 rather than turning into days, which is how it worked before. `old_format_hms` and `hms_summary` in `rows.py` both call `format_hms`, so they're fixed too.","session_id":"bfdcea0e-baa4-459c-b30f-1851d5ecad18","request_id":"4c22812a-8fc0-41e7-a227-6fb0267f8d7e","usage":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":1482,"cacheReadTokens":114489,"cacheWriteTokens":19118}}
